{"t":"Diapason","s":"diapason-fc2cc","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Diapason_91541d.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Diapason</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Diapason\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Diapason_91541d.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Tools and other Equipment<br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"pickupable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Pickupable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"weight\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Weight</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2.00 oz</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stackable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Stackable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Trade Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"marketable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Marketable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"value\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Value</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">15,000 - 150,000 gp</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcvalue\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Sold for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not bought by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"npcprice\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Bought for</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">(not sold by NPCs)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Utility Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"usable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9.10<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 6, 2011<br/>Summer Update 2011</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20110628233937&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Diapason_91541d.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a diapason.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 2.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">A hermit near Carlin might be able to tell you more about it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>A <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Diapason</strong> can be used to tame a <a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf\">Crystal Wolf</a>. Note: It has a chance of breaking when used.<br/> If you're successful, you'll see the message: <span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">The smooth sound of the diapason tamed the crystal wolf.</span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Edala\">Edala</a> will give this item to Characters who plays a <a href=\"#/wiki/Lyre\">Lyre</a> near her 7 times, each time being at least 24 hours (real life time) apart. Someone can only receive one Diapason per character.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>1st day:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">&lt;plink plonk&gt;</span><br/><i>Player</i>: hi<br/>Edala: Ashari, <i>Player</i>. How... nice to see a human taking interest in a beautiful art such as music.<br/><br/>\n2nd day:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">&lt;plonk plonk craaaaaaaaaank~&gt;</span><br/><i>Player</i>: hi<br/>Edala: Ashari, <i>Player</i>... that sound was.. interesting.<br/><br/>\n3rd day:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">&lt;twannnngggggg~&gt;</span><br/><i>Player</i>: hi<br/>Edala: Ashari, <i>Player</i>. You've made some... progress playing the lyre, haven't you..? I want to believe you have.<br/><br/>\n4th day:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">&lt;creek creeeek creeeekkk~&gt;</span><br/><i>Player</i>: hi<br/>Edala: <i>Player</i>. My regular visitor. I certainly... appreciate your efforts to entertain me, but let me assure you, I'm quite comfortable up here by myself. Alone. In silence.<br/><br/>\n5th day:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">&lt;dweeee dweee dwweeeee~&gt;</span><br/><i>Player</i>: hi<br/>Edala: Ashari, <i>Player</i>. I'm starting to feel a little sorry... for your lyre. Being forced to produce such noise must be a tragic fate.<br/><br/>\n6th day:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">&lt;prrrrrrrrrongggggg~&gt;</span><br/><i>Player</i>: hi<br/>Edala: <i>Player</i>! You're driving me insane! I beg you, take your lyre away from this sacred and peaceful place.<br/><br/>\n7th day:<br/><span class=\"sounds tibiatext tibiaorange\">&lt;dlangggg~&gt;</span><br/><i>Player</i>: hi<br/>Edala: AAAARGH! <i>Player</i>! My ears! I'd prefer listening to drunken dwarves rambling all day to the sound of your lyre! Please, at least get it tuned. Here, you can have this elvish <b>diapason</b>.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Diapason</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf\">Crystal Wolf</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystal%20Wolf%20%28Mount%29\">Crystal Wolf (Mount)</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edala\">Edala</a></li><li>Guide:Mounts</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lyre\">Lyre</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Taming%20Items\">Taming Items</a></li><li>The Right Tone</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/thornfire-world-change\">Thornfire World Change</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div></div>","quests":["thornfire-world-change"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"thornfire-world-change","quest":"Thornfire World Change","step":"3-1","n":11,"title":"Transformar e domar","kind":"needed","coords":[{"x":33125,"y":32147,"z":7,"label":"Templo do bog god (Bog Water)"}]}]}}